    label: 'Cyclic base change',
    from: 'GLₙ/ℚ',
    to:   'Res_{E/ℚ} GLₙ',
    rho:  'GLₙ(ℂ) ↪ (GLₙ(ℂ))^{[E:ℚ]} ⋊ Gal(E/ℚ)',
    example: 'Cuspidal π on GLₙ(𝔸_ℚ) lifts to Gal(E/ℚ)-invariant Π on GLₙ(𝔸_E).',
    satake: '(α₁, …, αₙ) ↦ (α₁^{[E:ℚ]}, …, αₙ^{[E:ℚ]}) at split primes.',
